{"page":341,"verses":[{"verse_key":"22:73","surah":22,"ayah":73,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّاسُ ضُرِبَ مَثَلٌ فَٱسْتَمِعُوا۟ لَهُۥٓ ۚ إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ تَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ لَن يَخْلُقُوا۟ ذُبَابًا وَلَوِ ٱجْتَمَعُوا۟ لَهُۥ ۖ وَإِن يَسْلُبْهُمُ ٱلذُّبَابُ شَيْـًٔا لَّا يَسْتَنقِذُوهُ مِنْهُ ۚ ضَعُفَ ٱلطَّالِبُ وَٱلْمَطْلُوبُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"People, here is an illustration, so listen carefully: those you call on beside God could not, even if they combined all their forces, create a fly, and if a fly took something away from them, they would not be able to retrieve it. How feeble are the petitioners and how feeble are those they petition!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O mankind","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"O mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsu","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ضُرِبَ","en_gloss":"Is set forth","transliteration":"ḍuriba","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَثَلٌۭ","en_gloss":"an example","transliteration":"mathalun","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَٱسْتَمِعُوا۟","en_gloss":"so listen","transliteration":"fa-is'tamiʿū","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُۥٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"to it","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"you invoke","transliteration":"tadʿūna","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides Allah","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":11,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"besides Allah","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"besides Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَن","en_gloss":"will never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَخْلُقُوا۟","en_gloss":"create","transliteration":"yakhluqū","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ذُبَابًۭا","en_gloss":"a fly","transliteration":"dhubāban","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلَوِ","en_gloss":"even if","transliteration":"walawi","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱجْتَمَعُوا۟","en_gloss":"they gathered together","transliteration":"ij'tamaʿū","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لَهُۥ ۖ","en_gloss":"for it","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":20,"ar":"يَسْلُبْهُمُ","en_gloss":"snatched away from them","transliteration":"yaslub'humu","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلذُّبَابُ","en_gloss":"the fly","transliteration":"l-dhubābu","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":22,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا","en_gloss":"a thing","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":23,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":24,"ar":"يَسْتَنقِذُوهُ","en_gloss":"they (could) take it back","transliteration":"yastanqidhūhu","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":25,"ar":"مِنْهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hu","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":26,"ar":"ضَعُفَ","en_gloss":"So weak","transliteration":"ḍaʿufa","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱلطَّالِبُ","en_gloss":"(are) the seeker","transliteration":"l-ṭālibu","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":28,"ar":"وَٱلْمَطْلُوبُ","en_gloss":"and the one who is sought","transliteration":"wal-maṭlūbu","verse_key":"22:73"},{"pos":29,"ar":"٧٣","en_gloss":"(73)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:73"}]},{"verse_key":"22:74","surah":22,"ayah":74,"ar_uthmani":"مَا قَدَرُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ حَقَّ قَدْرِهِۦٓ ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَقَوِىٌّ عَزِيزٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They have no grasp of God’s true measure: God is truly most strong and mighty.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"22:74"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَدَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they (have) estimated","transliteration":"qadarū","verse_key":"22:74"},{"pos":3,"a