{"pos":11,"ar":"بَصِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Seer","transliteration":"baṣīrun","verse_key":"22:75"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٧٥","en_gloss":"(75)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:75"}]},{"verse_key":"22:76","surah":22,"ayah":76,"ar_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ مَا بَيْنَ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَمَا خَلْفَهُمْ ۗ وَإِلَى ٱللَّهِ تُرْجَعُ ٱلْأُمُورُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He knows what lies before and behind them. All matters return to Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"He knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"22:76"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"22:76"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"(is) before them","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"22:76"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"(is) before them","transliteration":"aydīhim","verse_key":"22:76"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"22:76"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَلْفَهُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"(is) after them","transliteration":"khalfahum","verse_key":"22:76"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَإِلَى","en_gloss":"And to","transliteration":"wa-ilā","verse_key":"22:76"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"22:76"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تُرْجَعُ","en_gloss":"return","transliteration":"tur'jaʿu","verse_key":"22:76"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأُمُورُ","en_gloss":"all the matters","transliteration":"l-umūru","verse_key":"22:76"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٧٦","en_gloss":"(76)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:76"}]},{"verse_key":"22:77","surah":22,"ayah":77,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱرْكَعُوا۟ وَٱسْجُدُوا۟ وَٱعْبُدُوا۟ رَبَّكُمْ وَٱفْعَلُوا۟ ٱلْخَيْرَ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُفْلِحُونَ ۩","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, bow down, prostrate yourselves, worship your Lord, and do good so that you may succeed.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"22:77"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"allad